  "title": "Intelligent Protection Management Corp. to Host First Quarter 2025 Earnings Results Conference Call on Wednesday, May 14, 2025 at 4:30 p.m. EDT",
  "summary": "Jericho, NY – May 8, 2025 – Intelligent Protection Management Corp. (“IPM,” the “Company,” “we,” “our” or “us”) (Nasdaq: IPM), a managed technology solutions provider focused on cybersecurity and cloud infrastructure, today announced that it will host its first quarter 2025 earnings results conference call on Wednesday, May 14, 2025 at 4:30 p.m. Eastern Time.",
